    "Input: w = [5.0], m = [0.1], v = [0.01], grad = [0.2], lr = 0.01, beta1 = 0.9, beta2 = 0.999, weight_decay = 0.05, eps = 1e-8\n\nOutput: {\"new_w\": [4.986516], \"new_m\": [0.11], \"new_v\": [0.01003]}",
